## The Shade That Does Not Need Permission

<strong>Burgundy nails</strong> have never required a trend cycle to justify them. They exist outside that logic. Every September the shade re-earns its place not because a runway declared it or a search volume confirmed it, but because it is genuinely, structurally one of the most beautiful colours a manicure can carry.

The readers who arrive here in autumn already know this. What they want, and what this guide is for, is the information that makes their burgundy choice precise: the right shade for their skin, the right finish for their intention, the designs that make the colour feel new even when it is familiar.

Pick your burgundy with the undertone guide. Choose your finish by occasion, not habit. Let it carry you through autumn and winter and, when spring arrives with its pastel overtures, wear your wine red against the season and let the contrast be the statement. For every shade the season calls for, <a href='/blog/nails-by-color/nail-colors'>Nail Colors: The Ultimate Guide to Every Trending Shade</a> has the full picture.
